      <groundspeak:encoded_hints>29.7M N. OF N/SIDE  PARKNG LOT

ASC CAP ON E/SIDE OF 10 ST NW IN CONFEDERATION PARK ACROSS FROM ROSEMONT COMMUNITY CENTER 22.0 M E OF
